flowchart TD

    Dev[Git Commit] --> CI[CI: Full Tree Snapshot]

    CI --> FB1[FlashBlade Region A]
    FB1 -->|Async Bucket Replication| FB2[FlashBlade Region B]

    FB1 --> NodesA[Nodes Region A]
    FB2 --> NodesB[Nodes Region B]

    NodesA -->|Jitter + rsync reconcile| SwitchA[Atomic Switch]
    NodesB -->|Jitter + rsync reconcile| SwitchB[Atomic Switch]
